    "title": {
      "en": "New Ring of Blood Style Quest Coming in WoW: Forever",
      "es": "Nuevo Ring of Blood Style Quest en WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "New Ring of Blood Style Quest Coming in WoW: Forever...",
      "es": "El nuevo Ring of Blood Style Quest llegará en WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad7928eda48b9.05940244\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In the latest video released on World of Warcraft's YouTube channel, Blizzard highlights the leveling journey past the Beta level cap of 30 and also announces a new Ring of Blood-style quest coming to the new zone: <a data-entity=\"zone\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/zone=16591/riverglades\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Riverglades</span></a>.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hTCBfrFZ2qU/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br>The Riverglades is a new zone players can enter around level 36 and offers hubs and quests for both the Horde and the Alliance; we've also learned it will now host a very popular Ring of Blood-like arena: The Bloodmasters Ring. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306107.jpg\" id=\"1306107\"><img width=\"700\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306107.jpg?maxWidth=700\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Bloodmasters Ring WoW Fortever\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.93004 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>The Ring of Blood originally appeared as a Burning Crusade quest series, where players challenge powerful competitors to become the arena champion. This has had iterations in nearly every single expansion to follow, all the way to Dragonflight. One must wonder if the two original ringmasters, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/npc=18471/gurgthock\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Gurgthock</a> and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/npc=22893/wodin-the-troll-servant\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Wodin</a>, are also returning to host this competition.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306109.jpg\" id=\"1306109\"><img width=\"700\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306109.jpg?maxWidth=700\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image border\" alt=\"Ring of Blood TBC\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.19178 / 1; border-width: 2px;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>In the latest video released on World of Warcraft's YouTube channel, Blizzard highlights the leveling journey past the Beta level cap of 30 and also announces a new Ring of Blood-style quest coming to the new zone: <a href=\"/zone=16591/riverglades\">Riverglades</a>.<br /><br />The Riverglades is a new zone players can enter around level 36 and offers hubs and quests for both the Horde and the Alliance; we've also learned it will now host a very popular Ring of Blood-like arena: The Bloodmasters Ring. <br /><br />The Ring of Blood originally appeared as a Burning Crusade quest series, where players challenge powerful competitors to become the arena champion. This has had iterations in nearly every single expansion to follow, all the way to Dragonflight. One must wonder if the two original ringmasters, <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/npc=18471/gurgthock\">Gurgthock</a> and <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/tbc/npc=22893/wodin-the-troll-servant\">Wodin</a>, are also returning to host this competition.<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55830-new-ring-of-blood-style-quest-coming-in-wow-forever.jpg",
