    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Ascendant Venomstones Unlock Tomorrow - Finish Quest to Prepare",
      "es": "Las piedras venenosas ascendentes se desbloquean mañana: termina la misión para prepararte"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Ascendant Venomstones Unlock Tomorrow - Finish Quest to Prepare...",
      "es": "Ascendant Venomstones Unlock Tomorrow - Finaliza la misión para prepararte..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad7945828cc23.84321682\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">If you want to be ready for Ascendant Venomstones tomorrow, make sure you finish the prerequisite quest today!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/bonus-rolls-item-upgrades\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Ascendant Venomstones</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_1205_voidforge_sovereignvoidcorefragments_green.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Similar to how players unlocked <a class=\"icontiny q1\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"currency\" data-entity=\"currency\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/currency=3418/nebulous-voidcore\"><span><img alt=\"Nebulous Voidcore\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_1205_voidforge_fluctuatingvoidcores_green.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Nebulous Voidcore</span></span></a> at the Catalyst, players can pick up the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"quest\" data-entity=\"quest\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/quest=98379/ancient-depths-ancient-venom\"><img alt=\"Ancient Depths, Ancient Venom\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ancient Depths, Ancient Venom</span></a> quest from <a data-entity=\"npc\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=269987/orin-straylight\"><span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Orin Straylight</span></a> this week. Players will be tasked with collecting 3 items that drop from LFR bosses in the Venomous Abyss or Ancient Foes in the Vaults of Atal'Utek. The quest text doesn't explicitly mention it, but completing <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/nymrissa-wavecaller-tidebound-grotto-lair-boss-strategy-rewards\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Nymrissa Wavecaller</a> on World difficulty across 3 characters is a very efficient way of completing it. <br><br>Finishing this quest once across your Warband will unlock <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Ascendant Venomstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_1205_voidforge_sovereignvoidcorefragments_green.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ascendant Venomstone</span></a> with the weekly reset. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"catalyst.jpg\" width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55822.jpg?maxWidth=800\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.7777777777777777\"></div><br><br>Once the Weekly Reset hits, players who have completed this quest can start to collect <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Ascendant Venomstone\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_1205_voidforge_sovereignvoidcorefragments_green.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Ascendant Venomstone</span></a> from Heroic or Mythic Venomous Abyss bosses, Mythic+ dungeons at +10 or higher, Tier 11 Bountiful Delves, and Nightmare Prey. In Season 2, upgrading a piece of gear takes 10 of this currency (up from 5 in Season 1) and can be used on any fully upgraded Hero or Myth track item, or max-quality Crafted Gear. Items that are already Myth 9/<wbr>6 from Coiled Altar and Ula'tek cannot be upgraded further.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>If you want to be ready for Ascendant Venomstones tomorrow, make sure you finish the prerequisite quest today!<br /><br />Ascendant Venomstones<br /><br />Similar to how players unlocked <a href=\"/currency=3418/nebulous-voidcore\">Nebulous Voidcore</a> at the Catalyst, players can pick up the <a href=\"/quest=98379/ancient-depths-ancient-venom\">Ancient Depths, Ancient Venom</a> quest from <a href=\"/npc=269987/orin-straylight\">Orin Straylight</a> this week. Players will be tasked with collecting 3 items that drop from LFR bosses in the Venomous Abyss or Ancient Foes in the Vaults of Atal'Utek. The quest text doesn't explicitly mention it, but completing Nymrissa Wavecaller on World difficulty across 3 characters is a very efficient way of completing it. <br /><br />Finishing this quest once across your Warband will unlock <a href=\"/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\">Ascendant Venomstone</a> with the weekly reset. <br /><br />Once the Weekly Reset hits, players who have completed this quest can start to collect <a href=\"/item=280562/ascendant-venomstone\">Ascendant Venomstone</a> from Heroic or Mythic Venomous Abyss bosses, Mythic+ dungeons at +10 or higher, Tier 11 Bountiful Delves, and Nightmare Prey. In Season 2, upgrading a piece of gear takes 10 of this currency (up from 5 in Season 1) and can be used on any fully upgraded Hero or Myth track item, or max-quality Crafted Gear. Items that are already Myth 9/6 from Coiled Altar and Ula'tek cannot be upgraded further.</noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55822-ascendant-venomstones-unlock-tomorrow-finish-quest-to-prepare.jpg",
