    "title": {
      "en": "Rexxar Transmog Pack Returns to the Battle.net Store",
      "es": "Rexxar Transfiguración Pack vuelve a la tienda de Battle.net"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Rexxar Transmog Pack Returns to the Battle.net Store...",
      "es": "Rexxar Transfiguración Pack vuelve a la tienda de Battle.net..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad7946d89b7d3.35960239\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The Champion of the Wilds Pack has returned to the Battle.net Store and will remain available until November 8th. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-champion-of-the-wilds-pack\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Champion of the Wilds Pack</span></a></div><br><br>At the end of last week, Blizzard quietly <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/rexxar-shop-pack-removed-from-battle-net-store-383464\" data-contiguous=\"true\">removed the Rexxar Transmog pack from the Battle.net store,</a> likely due to the transmog being bugged. This was mentioned on <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1x6tdjx/we_accidentally_got_rexxars_latex_collection_the/?sort=top\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Reddit</a> and on the <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/rexxars-fabled-attire-is-not-working-properly-at-all/2383341\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">official Forums</a>.<br><br>The Champion of the Wilds pack has returned to the <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-champion-of-the-wilds-pack\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Battle.net Store</a> and can be purchased for $30 USD /<wbr> $32 CAD.<br><br>This pack grants you a Transmog Set, a Toy that turns your Hunter Pet and a piece of Housing Decor.<ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=283360\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><span class=\"q4\">Ensemble: Rexxar's Fabled Attire</span></a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=284572/rexxars-companion-transformation\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Rexxar's Companion Transformation\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_rexxar.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Rexxar's Companion Transformation</span></a></div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=281372/zhevraskin-rug\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><span class=\"q2\">Zhevraskin Rug</span></a></div></li></ul><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305703.jpg\" id=\"1305703\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305703.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Rexxar Transmog\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.39586 / 1;\"></a><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305704.png\" id=\"1305704\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305704.png?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Huffer\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.10792 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305705.png\" id=\"1305705\"><img width=\"400\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305705.png?maxWidth=400\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"Misha\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 1.07932 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The Champion of the Wilds Pack has returned to the Battle.net Store and will remain available until November 8th. <br /><br />Champion of the Wilds Pack<br /><br />At the end of last week, Blizzard quietly <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/rexxar-shop-pack-removed-from-battle-net-store-383464\">removed the Rexxar Transmog pack from the Battle.net store,</a> likely due to the transmog being bugged. This was mentioned on <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1x6tdjx/we_accidentally_got_rexxars_latex_collection_the/?sort=top\">Reddit</a> and on the <a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/rexxars-fabled-attire-is-not-working-properly-at-all/2383341\" rel=\"nofollow\">official Forums</a>.<br /><br />The Champion of the Wilds pack has returned to the <a href=\"https://us.shop.battle.net/en-us/product/world-of-warcraft-champion-of-the-wilds-pack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Battle.net Store</a> and can be purchased for $30 USD / $32 CAD.<br /><br />This pack grants you a Transmog Set, a Toy that turns your Hunter Pet and a piece of Housing Decor.<br /><br /><ul><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=283360\">Ensemble: Rexxar's Fabled Attire</a></li><li><a href=\"/item=284572/rexxars-companion-transformation\">Rexxar's Companion Transformation</a></li><li><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/item=281372/zhevraskin-rug\">Zhevraskin Rug</a></li></ul><br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55831-rexxar-transmog-pack-returns-to-the-battle-net-store.jpg",
