      "es": "Ocho horas de mantenimiento programadas para los servidores NA mañana..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad7944398a245.13717400\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">If you plan on playing World of Warcraft tomorrow, be warned! NA servers for Retail have eight hours of maintenance scheduled for tomorrow.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://us.support.blizzard.com/en/help/article/000358479\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Maintenance Schedule</span></a></div><br><br>Despite eight hours of maintenance scheduled for Patch 12.1.5 last week, there are another <a href=\"https://us.support.blizzard.com/en/help/article/000358479\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">eight hours of maintenance scheduled</a> for this week. <br><br>Maintenance is scheduled from 7:00 AM to 3:00 PM Pacific time.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306104.png\" id=\"1306104\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1306104.png?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"maintenance\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 4.88 / 1;\"></a>&nbsp;</div><br><br>This weekly reset includes <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/official-12-1-5-patch-notes-class-changes-labyrinths-kithix-raid-383206\" data-contiguous=\"true\">Ascendant Venomstones and Uncapped Crests</a>, and Blizzard may want the extra time to make sure that things are working correctly.</div>\n            \n            <noscript>If you plan on playing World of Warcraft tomorrow, be warned! NA servers for Retail have eight hours of maintenance scheduled for tomorrow.<br /><br />Maintenance Schedule<br /><br />Despite eight hours of maintenance scheduled for Patch 12.1.5 last week, there are another <a href=\"https://us.support.blizzard.com/en/help/article/000358479\" rel=\"nofollow\">eight hours of maintenance scheduled</a> for this week. <br /><br />Maintenance is scheduled from 7:00 AM to 3:00 PM Pacific time.<br /><br />This weekly reset includes <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/official-12-1-5-patch-notes-class-changes-labyrinths-kithix-raid-383206\">Ascendant Venomstones and Uncapped Crests</a>, and Blizzard may want the extra time to make sure that things are working correctly.</noscript>            \n        ",
