    "title": {
      "en": "The Journey Past Level 30 in WoW: Forever - The Riverglades and Hyjal Zones",
      "es": "El viaje más allá del nivel 30 en WoW: Forever - The Riverglades and Hyjal Zones"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "The Journey Past Level 30 in WoW: Forever - The Riverglades and Hyjal Zones...",
      "es": "The Journey Past Level 30 in WoW: Forever - The Riverglades and Hyjal Zones..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad792d4cce533.00994079\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta caps players at level 30, but Blizzard has released a video teasing what is next for players as they level to 60!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hTCBfrFZ2qU/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 800px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 45%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><br><br><span class=\"large-text\">New Zones</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Riverglades - Builds on Factions from Warcraft's past.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Mount Hyjal - Climax of your leveling journey.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Riverglades - Alliance</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Alliance players encounter a new faction from Warcraft II, the Brotherhood of the Horse.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">These are remnants of the Elite Knights of Stormwind who fought at the Battle of Blackrock Mountain.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The Knights of the Brotherhood disobeyed their orders to chase the Horde remnants down who were attacking undefended Alliance lands.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The remnants of these knights are at Farhold Keep in the Riverglades.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Riverglades - Horde</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Horde players will meet the Boulderrock Ogre clan are former members of the Twilight Hammer clan.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">There are enemies on all sides, including their old masters of the Twilight Hammer in a nearby Fortress.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Riverglades</span><ul class=\"exclude-units\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Both factions will clash with the Twilight's Hammer.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">That story is surrounded by other stories such as wrecking a pirate operation, rescuing a horse and Jom-Jom.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Deep within ogre territory is a fighting ring where players will fight against the Ogre's best brawlers.</div></li></ul><span class=\"large-text\">Hyjal</span><ul class=\"last\"><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">For the first time since the Third War, the road into Hyjal has opened.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Players will work alongside the Druids of the Talon and other members of the Cenarion Circle to rebuild.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Members of the Horde and Alliance have been forced to live together in an uneasy agreement.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">With the gates open, the tensions are heating up again.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">A crow has uncovered sinister walrocks and activity involving the Wild King.</div></li><li><div data-markup-content-target=\"1\">The new 10-player raid, Barrow Deeps awaits in Hyjal. It's a prison that held Azeroth's most infamous betrayer.</div></li></ul></div>\n            \n            <noscript>The World of Warcraft: Forever Beta caps players at level 30, but Blizzard has released a video teasing what is next for players as they level to 60!<br /><br />New Zones<br /><br /><ul><li>Riverglades - Builds on Factions from Warcraft's past.</li><li>Mount Hyjal - Climax of your leveling journey.</li></ul><br /><br />Riverglades - Alliance<br /><br /><ul><li>Alliance players encounter a new faction from Warcraft II, the Brotherhood of the Horse.</li><li>These are remnants of the Elite Knights of Stormwind who fought at the Battle of Blackrock Mountain.</li><li>The Knights of the Brotherhood disobeyed their orders to chase the Horde remnants down who were attacking undefended Alliance lands.</li><li>The remnants of these knights are at Farhold Keep in the Riverglades.</li></ul><br /><br />Riverglades - Horde<br /><br /><ul><li>Horde players will meet the Boulderrock Ogre clan are former members of the Twilight Hammer clan. </li><li> There are enemies on all sides, including their old masters of the Twilight Hammer in a nearby Fortress.</li></ul><br /><br />Riverglades<br /><br /><ul><li>Both factions will clash with the Twilight's Hammer.</li><li>That story is surrounded by other stories such as wrecking a pirate operation, rescuing a horse and Jom-Jom.</li><li>Deep within ogre territory is a fighting ring where players will fight against the Ogre's best brawlers.</li></ul><br /><br />Hyjal<br /><br /><ul><li>For the first time since the Third War, the road into Hyjal has opened.</li><li>Players will work alongside the Druids of the Talon and other members of the Cenarion Circle to rebuild.</li><li>Members of the Horde and Alliance have been forced to live together in an uneasy agreement.</li><li>With the gates open, the tensions are heating up again.</li><li>A crow has uncovered sinister walrocks and activity involving the Wild King.</li><li>The new 10-player raid, Barrow Deeps awaits in Hyjal. It's a prison that held Azeroth's most infamous betrayer.</li></ul></noscript>            \n        ",
