    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Acknowledges Labyrinth Launch Bugs and Extends Limited-Time Achievement by One Extra Week",
      "es": "Blizzard reconoce los errores del lanzamiento de Labyrinth y amplía los logros por tiempo limitado una semana más"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Acknowledges Labyrinth Launch Bugs and Extends Limited-Time Achievement by One Extra Week...",
      "es": "Blizzard reconoce los errores de lanzamiento del laberinto y extiende el logro por tiempo limitado por una semana adicional..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad792fb195dd1.49494111\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has acknowledged the Labyrinth bugs that launched with Patch 12.1.5 and has extended the limited-time achievement of defeating Kindo'jan by one week. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_cape_armor_troll_d_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>When Patch 12.1.5 launched, many players started to note <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/multiple-bugs-preventing-progress-in-labyrinths-forcing-383409\" data-contiguous=\"true\">progression-ending bugs in Labyrinths</a>. Some of these bugs, Blizzard had claimed to fix in hotfixes, and then <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/players-reporting-progression-bricking-bugs-still-persist-in-labyrinths-383439\" data-contiguous=\"true\">had to be fixed again</a>. There were other bugs affecting the completion of Labyrinths, such as <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/blizzard-identifies-likely-issue-of-falling-through-kindojans-platform-in-383473\" data-contiguous=\"true\">falling through the floor</a>, which took until Friday to fix. Because of all these bugs, Blizzard has extended the <a class=\"icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"achievement\" data-entity=\"achievement\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/achievement=64039/fabled-let-me-solo-him-kindojan\"><img alt=\"Fabled Let Me Solo Him: Kindo'jan\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_controlisking.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Fabled Let Me Solo Him: Kindo'jan</span></a> achievement by one week.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2387015/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We acknowledge that there were bugs in the first week of the 12.1.5 content update that impacted the ability to complete Labyrinth runs, including those pursuing the <i>Fabled Let Me Solo Him: Kindo’jan</i> achievement. We have now addressed the vast majority of these bugs, and to accommodate players who may have had their experience impacted in the first week, we are extending the deadline to complete the achievement by an additional week. This gives players the chance to earn this achievement until scheduled weekly maintenance on October 27 in this region.<br><br>Good luck conquering Kindo’jan and earning your place among the Fabled Vanquishers!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has acknowledged the Labyrinth bugs that launched with Patch 12.1.5 and has extended the limited-time achievement of defeating Kindo'jan by one week. <br /><br />Labyrinth of Kindo'jan<br /><br />When Patch 12.1.5 launched, many players started to note <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/multiple-bugs-preventing-progress-in-labyrinths-forcing-383409\">progression-ending bugs in Labyrinths</a>. Some of these bugs, Blizzard had claimed to fix in hotfixes, and then <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/players-reporting-progression-bricking-bugs-still-persist-in-labyrinths-383439\">had to be fixed again</a>. There were other bugs affecting the completion of Labyrinths, such as <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/blizzard-identifies-likely-issue-of-falling-through-kindojans-platform-in-383473\">falling through the floor</a>, which took until Friday to fix. Because of all these bugs, Blizzard has extended the <a href=\"/achievement=64039/fabled-let-me-solo-him-kindojan\">Fabled Let Me Solo Him: Kindo'jan</a> achievement by one week.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We acknowledge that there were bugs in the first week of the 12.1.5 content update that impacted the ability to complete Labyrinth runs, including those pursuing the <i>Fabled Let Me Solo Him: Kindo’jan</i> achievement. We have now addressed the vast majority of these bugs, and to accommodate players who may have had their experience impacted in the first week, we are extending the deadline to complete the achievement by an additional week. This gives players the chance to earn this achievement until scheduled weekly maintenance on October 27 in this region.<br /><br />Good luck conquering Kindo’jan and earning your place among the Fabled Vanquishers!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
